      "id": 4,
      "shona": "Masvingo eGreat Zimbabwe izvi zvinova zvivakwa zvematombo zviri munzvimbo yeMasvingo. Inzvimbo inonyanyawo kushanyirwa nevanhu vachiona mararamiro aiitawo vanhu kare uyewo pane vanhu vari kuratidza kuti vakamira vauya kuzoshanya panzvimbo iyi.",
